## Evidence labels for Genesis Conductor research

- Every factual statement about packet artifacts carries FACT (observable: DOI, HTTP 200, code/tests) or CLAIM (asserted, unreproduced).
- No NSF CAIG / NSF / EU funding attribution to Igor Holt.
- No Delta Truth divergence or consensus figures presented as measurements.
- No partner, customer, or endorsement claims unless a signed source is in the packet.
- Prefer linking a DOI or repo over paraphrasing results.
